{
    "comment": "쇼핑몰 설정 — 메일 템플릿 편집 창. 제목과 본문을 **언어별로** 고친다.\n  \n  언어 전환이 탭 버튼이고 실제 입력칸은 언어마다 따로 있다 — 한 칸을 언어에 따라 갈아 끼우지\n  않고 둘을 나란히 두되 보이는 쪽만 바꾼다. 그래서 다른 언어로 옮겨도 입력 중이던 값이 살아 있다.\n  \n  값은 `$parent._local.editingTemplate` 에 있다 — 목록 화면이 편집 대상을 그 자리에 담아 두고\n  저장도 그 화면 기준으로 돌아가기 때문이다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "이커머스 메일 템플릿 편집 모달"
    },
    "id": "modal_ecommerce_mail_template_edit",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.title",
        "size": "xl",
        "closeOnOverlayClick": false
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "ecommerce_edit_form_container",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "blur_until_loaded": "{{$parent._local.isSaving}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "flex flex-col max-h-[70vh]"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-5 pr-1"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "ecommerce_validation_error_banner",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "alert-danger"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex gap-3"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "triangle-exclamation",
                                                "size": "sm",
                                                "className": "text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "H3",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-error-strong"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.validation_error"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Ul",
                                                    "if": "{{typeof $parent._local.templateErrors === 'object' && Object.keys($parent._local.templateErrors).length > 0}}",
                                                    "iteration": {
                                                        "source": "Object.entries($parent._local.templateErrors ?? {}).flatMap(([field, messages]) => Array.isArray(messages) ? messages : [messages])",
                                                        "item_var": "errMsg"
                                                    },
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "mt-2 list-disc list-inside space-y-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Li",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "text-error-soft"
                                                            },
                                                            "text": "{{errMsg}}"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-center gap-2 mb-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-label-subtle font-medium"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.type_label"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-primary text-sm font-semibold"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.types.{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.type ?? ''}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-tertiary font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.type ?? ''}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "한국어 탭. 어느 언어를 보고 있는지만 바꾸고 값은 건드리지 않는다 — 입력칸이 언어마다 따로 있어 옮겨도 입력 중이던 값이 살아 있다.",
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "$parent._local",
                                                "editLang": "ko"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "className": "{{($parent._local.editLang ?? $locale) === 'ko' ? 'border-b-2 border-indigo-500 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400' : 'text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 dark:hover:text-gray-300'}} px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-none"
                                    },
                                    "text": "한국어"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "영어 탭. 짝인 한국어 탭과 같이 보이는 쪽만 바꾼다.",
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "$parent._local",
                                                "editLang": "en"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "className": "{{($parent._local.editLang ?? $locale) === 'en' ? 'border-b-2 border-indigo-500 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400' : 'text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 dark:hover:text-gray-300'}} px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-none"
                                    },
                                    "text": "English"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "ecommerce_edit_subject_ko",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{($parent._local.editLang ?? $locale) === 'ko'}}",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Label",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-label"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.subject"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-required"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "*"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Input",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "한국어 제목.",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "$parent._local",
                                                        "editingTemplate.subject.ko": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "value": "{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.subject?.ko ?? ''}}",
                                                "className": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['subject.ko'] ? 'input-error' : ''}}",
                                                "disabled": "{{$parent._computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "if": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['subject.ko']}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-error-xs"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['subject.ko']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "ecommerce_edit_subject_en",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{($parent._local.editLang ?? $locale) === 'en'}}",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Label",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-label"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.subject"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Input",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "영어 제목. 비워 두면 그 언어로 메일이 나갈 때 제목이 빈다 — 화면이 막지는 않는다.",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "$parent._local",
                                                        "editingTemplate.subject.en": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "value": "{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.subject?.en ?? ''}}",
                                                "className": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['subject.en'] ? 'input-error' : ''}}",
                                                "disabled": "{{$parent._computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "if": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['subject.en']}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-error-xs"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['subject.en']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "ecommerce_edit_body_ko",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{($parent._local.editLang ?? $locale) === 'ko'}}",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Label",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-label"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.body"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-required"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "*"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "composite",
                                            "name": "HtmlEditor",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "한국어 본문. 위지윅이라 값이 HTML 문자열로 들어온다.",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "$parent._local",
                                                        "editingTemplate.body.ko": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "content": "{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.body?.ko ?? ''}}",
                                                "isHtml": true,
                                                "showHtmlModeToggle": false,
                                                "className": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['body.ko'] ? 'min-h-[200px] border border-red-500 rounded-md' : 'min-h-[200px]'}}",
                                                "disabled": "{{$parent._computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "if": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['body.ko']}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-error-xs"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['body.ko']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "ecommerce_edit_body_en",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{($parent._local.editLang ?? $locale) === 'en'}}",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Label",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-label"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.body"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "composite",
                                            "name": "HtmlEditor",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "영어 본문.",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "$parent._local",
                                                        "editingTemplate.body.en": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "content": "{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.body?.en ?? ''}}",
                                                "isHtml": true,
                                                "showHtmlModeToggle": false,
                                                "className": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['body.en'] ? 'min-h-[200px] border border-red-500 rounded-md' : 'min-h-[200px]'}}",
                                                "disabled": "{{$parent._computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "if": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['body.en']}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-error-xs"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{$parent._local.templateErrors?.['body.en']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "ecommerce_edit_is_active_toggle",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-center gap-3"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "composite",
                                    "name": "Toggle",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "사용 여부. 끄면 이 템플릿으로 나가는 메일이 멈춘다(템플릿은 남는다).",
                                            "type": "change",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "$parent._local",
                                                "editingTemplate.is_active": "{{$event.target.checked}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "ecommerceTemplateIsActive",
                                        "checked": "{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.is_active ?? true}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{$parent._computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-body"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.is_active_label"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "ecommerce_edit_variables_info",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{($parent._local.editingTemplate?.variables ?? []).length > 0}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-md p-4"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "H4",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-body font-medium mb-2"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.edit_modal.variables_title"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex flex-wrap gap-2"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "iteration": {
                                                "source": "{{$parent._local.editingTemplate?.variables ?? []}}",
                                                "item_var": "v",
                                                "index_var": "vi"
                                            },
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600 rounded text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "{"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "{{v.key}}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "} - {{v.description ?? ''}}"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "ecommerce_edit_modal_footer",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "modal-footer-buttons items-center px-4 py-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg sticky bottom-0"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex gap-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "ecommerce_btn_cancel_edit",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "closeModal",
                                            "target": "modal_ecommerce_mail_template_edit"
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "className": "text-body px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                        "disabled": "{{$parent._local.isSaving ?? false}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "ecommerce_btn_save_template",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "메일 문안 저장. 성공하면 템플릿 목록을 다시 부른다 — 목록이 제목과 사용 여부를 그대로 보여 주므로 갱신하지 않으면 방금 고친 값이 낡은 채로 남는다",
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "sequence",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "$parent._local",
                                                        "isSaving": true,
                                                        "templateErrors": null
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                                    "target": "{{'/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/mail-templates/' + $parent._local.editingTemplate?.id}}",
                                                    "auth_required": true,
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "method": "PUT",
                                                        "body": "{{(function() { const tpl = $parent._local.editingTemplate ?? {}; return { subject: tpl.subject ?? {}, body: tpl.body ?? {}, is_active: tpl.is_active ?? true }; })()}}"
                                                    },
                                                    "onSuccess": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "target": "$parent._local",
                                                                "isSaving": false,
                                                                "templateErrors": null,
                                                                "editingTemplate": null
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "closeModal",
                                                            "target": "modal_ecommerce_mail_template_edit"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "navigate",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "path": "/admin/ecommerce/settings",
                                                                "replace": true,
                                                                "mergeQuery": true,
                                                                "query": {}
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.save_success",
                                                                "type": "success"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ],
                                                    "onError": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "target": "$parent._local",
                                                                "isSaving": false,
                                                                "templateErrors": "{{error.errors}}"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "message": "{{error.message ?? $t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.mail_templates.save_error')}}",
                                                                "type": "error"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "className": "flex-center gap-2 text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md bg-indigo-600 text-white hover:bg-indigo-700 dark:bg-indigo-500 dark:hover:bg-indigo-600 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                        "disabled": "{{($parent._local.isSaving ?? false) || $parent._computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "if": "{{$parent._local.isSaving}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "spinner",
                                                "className": "animate-spin",
                                                "size": "sm"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "text": "{{$parent._local.isSaving ? '$t:common.saving' : '$t:common.save'}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
